   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Irregular nouns",
     "texto": [
      "**Imię** means «first name»; its genitive is **imienia**.",
      "**Przyjaciel** («friend») becomes **przyjaciela** in the genitive and accusative: the ending is not the same as in many regular nouns."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Presenting achievements",
     "texto": [
      "**Osiągnięcie** is an achievement; the plural is **osiągnięcia**.",
      "**Pieniądze** («money») usually appears only in the plural; in the genitive it is **pieniędzy**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
